      "role": "hook",
      "headline": "Chapter 3 finale: from a bench to a mountain of stone.",
      "body": "You’ve met the mastaba, the steps, the bend, the giant, its builders and its guardian. Here’s the whole climb, and one question left: why this shape?"
    },
    {
      "id": "card.ancient_egypt.030.c2",
      "type": "timeline",
      "headline": "The pyramid age, step by step",
